{'symbol': 'GD', 'date': '2022-07-20 11:30:00', 'title': 'GENERAL DYNAMICS MISSION SYSTEMS AWARDED $272.9 MILLION CONTRACT FOR US AND UK SUBMARINE FIRE CONTROL SYSTEMS', 'text': 'PITTSFIELD, MASS. , JULY 20, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GENERAL DYNAMICS MISSION SYSTEMS, A BUSINESS UNIT OF GENERAL DYNAMICS (NYSE: GD), ANNOUNCED TODAY IT WAS AWARDED\xa0A U.S. NAVY CONTRACT TO SUPPORT DEVELOPMENT, PRODUCTION AND INSTALLATION OF FIRE CONTROL SYSTEMS FOR THE COLUMBIA- AND DREADNOUGHT-CLASSES OF BALLISTIC MISSILE SUBMARINES.'}